---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { u } from "../lib/u";
---
<Layout title="Code of Conduct — CourseDepth" description="What we expect from everyone who writes a Udemy course review or comment on CourseDepth.">
<Header />
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Code of Conduct</h1><p>What we expect from everyone who writes a Udemy course review or comment on CourseDepth.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
<h2>Be honest and specific</h2>
<p>Review the course you actually took. Specific feedback about curriculum, updates and value helps other students far more than a score alone.</p>
<h2>No hate, no harassment</h2>
<p>Abusive language, personal attacks, discrimination and harassment of students or instructors are not tolerated and will be removed.</p>
<h2>No spam or self-promotion</h2>
<p>Do not post coupon spam, referral farming, copied content or marketing for your own courses. Repeated violations lead to a ban.</p>
<h2>No manipulation</h2>
<p>Buying, trading or coordinating reviews — in either direction — is prohibited. We may remove suspicious review bursts.</p>
<h2>Moderation</h2>
<p>We may edit, hide or delete content that breaks these rules, and we will explain why when you ask. Decisions can be appealed through the contact page.</p>
<p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:28px">Questions? <a href="/contact" style="font-weight:700">Contact us</a> — read more in our <a href="/about-us" style="font-weight:700">about page</a>.</p>
</div></section>
<Footer />
</Layout>
